    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>Your vantage is systems-level; your voice, the signal.</em></p><p>When an ally within <strong>6 squares</strong> makes a key roll directly tied to the current objective (attack on a critical target, clutch save, investigation breakthrough, negotiation pivot), you may use your <strong>reaction</strong> to steady the moment.</p><ul><li>The ally adds your <strong>tier</strong> to the roll.</li><li>You may use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, regaining all uses on a <strong>a Soma Break</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic Layer.</strong> When you lead a diplomatic, social, or morale-driven <em>scenario</em>, the <strong>first Soft Power OP spend</strong> your faction makes during that scenario is reduced by <strong>1 OP</strong> (minimum 1). This can occur once per scenario you lead.</p>",
